<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Privacy Policy | GlamouraVisuals</title>
  <meta name="description" content="How GlamouraVisuals handles visitor information." />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#09090b" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root { --bg:#09090b; --text:#f4f4f5; --muted:#a1a1aa; --faint:#8a8a93; --border:rgba(255,255,255,.12); --accent:#e8e8ec; --ink:#09090b; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { background: var(--bg); }
    body {
      margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; color: var(--text); font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; line-height: 1.8; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: .02em;
      background: radial-gradient(60vmax 60vmax at 10% -10%, rgba(99,102,241,.28), transparent 70%),
                  radial-gradient(50vmax 50vmax at 100% 20%, rgba(14,165,233,.16), transparent 70%), var(--bg);
    }
    header { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); background: rgba(9,9,11,.6); backdrop-filter: blur(16px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px); }
    .bar { max-width: 52rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; height: 5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    .logo { color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 800; font-size: .95rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .3em; }
    .logo span { font-weight: 300; }
    .home { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .18em; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 999px; padding: .6rem 1.2rem; }
    .home:hover { color: var(--text); }
    main { max-width: 44rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 1.5rem 5rem; }
    .eyebrow { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .5em; color: var(--faint); margin: 0 0 1rem; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 .5rem; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 5vw, 2.4rem); font-weight: 300; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .2em; line-height: 1.3; }
    h2 { margin: 2.5rem 0 .5rem; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .22em; color: var(--text); }
    p, li { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14.5px; }
    ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
    a { color: var(--text); }
    .updated { color: var(--faint); font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .callout { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 1rem; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,.04); margin: 1.5rem 0; }
    .callout p { margin: 0; color: var(--text); }
    footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 2rem 1.5rem; text-align: center; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .1em; color: var(--faint); }
    footer a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; }
    footer a:hover { color: var(--text); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header><div class="bar">
    <a class="logo" href="index.html">Glamoura<span>Visuals</span></a>
    <a class="home" href="index.html">Back to the Edit</a>
  </div></header>
  <main>

    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: November 8, 2026</p>

    <p>GlamouraVisuals is a curated lifestyle lookbook. This page explains, in plain language, what happens to information when you visit the site.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>We do not ask you to create an account, and the site has no checkout or sign-up form. We do not knowingly collect names, emails or payment details through the site itself. If you email us, we receive your email address and message so we can reply.</p>

    <h2>What your browser stores</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Your chosen color theme is saved in your browser's local storage so it is remembered next time. It stays on your device and is never sent to us.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Services that may see your visit</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Hosting.</strong> The site is hosted by a third-party provider, which may keep standard server logs (such as IP address, browser type and pages requested) for security and operation.</li>
      <li><strong>Fonts, scripts and images.</strong> Pages load fonts from Google Fonts, styling from the Tailwind CDN, and photos from Unsplash and Pexels. Loading these resources means your browser contacts those services, and they may receive your IP address under their own privacy policies.</li>
      <li><strong>Search Console.</strong> We use a verification tag so we can confirm ownership of the site with Google Search Console.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not currently run advertising trackers or analytics on the site. If that changes, we will update this page first.</p>

    <h2>Affiliate links and third-party sites</h2>
    <p>Buttons on the site take you to retailers such as Amazon. Once you leave GlamouraVisuals, the retailer's own privacy policy applies. Affiliate links may use cookies set by the retailer so a qualifying purchase can be credited to us. See our <a href="disclosure.html">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>The site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect information from them.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can clear your browser's stored data at any time, block third-party cookies in your browser settings, or ask us to delete any email correspondence we hold from you.</p>

    <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy as the site grows, and the date above will change when we do. Questions? Use the details on our <a href="contact.html">Contact page</a>.</p>

  </main>
  <footer>
    <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="disclosure.html">Affiliate Disclosure</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    <p style="margin:.75rem 0 0;font-size:11px;">&copy; 2026 GlamouraVisuals</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
